  "'1 = 1 display unit' means the integer is the displayed value without its decimal point; apply the counter or rate decimal point setting yourself.",
  "Scale factor scaling (1 = 0.00001) is printed in the A/B list section (40051+) for the same parameter and applied here to the active-list copies at 40013-40018.",
